{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "Datasource del scrape OpenMetrics Temporal Cloud (v1)",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [
    { "type": "grafana", "id": "grafana", "name": "Grafana", "version": "10.0.0" },
    { "type": "datasource", "id": "prometheus", "name": "Prometheus", "version": "1.0.0" }
  ],
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "description": "Guardia SLO de Temporal Cloud (v1). Namespace es variable: All = todos los que scrapeas. Filtrar prod o una app en el dropdown, no en el JSON.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "title": "SLO — Start / Signal (Cloud)",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.005 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.01 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(temporal_cloud_v1_service_error_count{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\", operation=~\"StartWorkflowExecution|SignalWorkflowExecution|SignalWithStartWorkflowExecution\"}) / clamp_min(sum(temporal_cloud_v1_service_request_count{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\", operation=~\"StartWorkflowExecution|SignalWorkflowExecution|SignalWithStartWorkflowExecution\"}), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "error rate",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "service_error_count / service_request_count en Start, Signal y SignalWithStart. Es el RPC hacia Cloud, no el fail del workflow en el core. Amarillo 0.5%, rojo 1%. Si Requests/s = 0 este % no sirve (no hay tráfico). P1 a 10 min con piso 0.1 req/s. v1 ya es rate/s: no usar rate().",
      "title": "Error rate Start/Signal",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.001 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(temporal_cloud_v1_resource_exhausted_error_count{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\"})",
          "legendFormat": "exhausted",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "resource_exhausted_error_count: Cloud rechazó un burst que un recurso no absorbió. Los SDK reintentan. No es el throttle por action_limit (eso es el panel de al lado). El % medio de cuota puede seguir verde. Rojo si > 0. P1 a 2 min.",
      "title": "Resource exhausted / s",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.001 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(temporal_cloud_v1_total_action_throttled_count{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\"}) + sum(temporal_cloud_v1_operations_throttled_count{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\"}) + sum(temporal_cloud_v1_service_request_throttled_count{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\"})",
          "legendFormat": "throttled",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Suma de total_action_throttled_count + operations_throttled_count + service_request_throttled_count. Cloud frenó por cuota de Actions, operations o RPS del frontend. Distinto de exhausted (burst de un recurso). Rojo si > 0. P1 a 2 min.",
      "title": "Throttle (actions+ops+RPS) / s",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.001 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
      "id": 5,
      "options": { "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(temporal_cloud_v1_no_poller_tasks_count{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\"})",
          "legendFormat": "no poller",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "no_poller_tasks_count: matching de Cloud no encontró poller en la task queue. Worker caído, TQ mal nombrada, deploy, HPA a 0. Cloud puede estar sano (D01 verde). No diagnostica el pod. Rojo si > 0. P1 a 3 min.",
      "title": "No poller tasks / s",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true }, "unit": "percentunit" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 6,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (temporal_namespace) (temporal_cloud_v1_service_error_count{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\", operation=~\"StartWorkflowExecution|SignalWorkflowExecution|SignalWithStartWorkflowExecution\"}) / clamp_min(sum by (temporal_namespace) (temporal_cloud_v1_service_request_count{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\", operation=~\"StartWorkflowExecution|SignalWorkflowExecution|SignalWithStartWorkflowExecution\"}), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "{{temporal_namespace}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Misma ratio errors/requests de Start+Signal+SignalWithStart, sum by temporal_namespace. Con All seleccionado, un namespace malo no se diluye en el stat de arriba. No re-agregar entre namespaces para percentiles (aquí no hay p95).",
      "title": "Error rate Start/Signal por namespace",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true }, "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "id": 7,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (temporal_namespace) (temporal_cloud_v1_service_request_count{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\", operation=~\"StartWorkflowExecution|SignalWorkflowExecution|SignalWithStartWorkflowExecution\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{temporal_namespace}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "service_request_count de Start, Signal y SignalWithStart. Piso de volumen: sin tráfico el error rate 0% no prueba que Cloud acepte trabajo. La P1 de error rate exige > 0.1/s. Caída a 0 en horario hábil = StartSilence (P2), no paging solo por esto.",
      "title": "Requests Start/Signal / s (piso de volumen)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Matching, cola y workflows",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true }, "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "id": 9,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (temporal_namespace, temporal_task_queue) (temporal_cloud_v1_approximate_backlog_count{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{temporal_namespace}} {{temporal_task_queue}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "approximate_backlog_count por namespace y task queue. Gauge aproximado: puede sobrecontar tasks inválidas y resetear a 0 en TQ idle. Útil como tendencia (¿crece 15 min?), no como SLO exacto. P2 de ejemplo: > 100 por 15 min.",
      "title": "Backlog aproximado (Cloud)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true }, "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 14 },
      "id": 10,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (temporal_namespace, temporal_task_queue) (temporal_cloud_v1_no_poller_tasks_count{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{temporal_namespace}} {{temporal_task_queue}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "no_poller_tasks_count desglosado por temporal_task_queue. Identifica qué cola no tiene worker (workflow vs activity). Señal de matching Cloud; la causa está en el worker/SDK (corte siguiente).",
      "title": "No poller por task queue",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true }, "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 14 },
      "id": 11,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (temporal_namespace) (temporal_cloud_v1_namespace_open_workflows{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{temporal_namespace}} open",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "namespace_open_workflows: cuántos están abiertos ahora. Gauge. No es disponibilidad ni éxito. Subida sostenida = no cierran (bucle, CAN, worker que no avanza). P2 si > 150% vs hace 24 h. No paginar por el valor absoluto.",
      "title": "Open workflows (no es SLO)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true }, "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "id": 12,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (temporal_namespace, temporal_workflow_type) (temporal_cloud_v1_workflow_failed_count{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\"})",
          "legendFormat": "fail {{temporal_namespace}} {{temporal_workflow_type}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (temporal_namespace, temporal_workflow_type) (temporal_cloud_v1_workflow_timeout_count{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\"})",
          "legendFormat": "timeout {{temporal_namespace}} {{temporal_workflow_type}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "description": "workflow_failed_count y workflow_timeout_count por temporal_workflow_type. Failed incluye fallos de negocio (ApplicationFailure, compensación). Timeout = se venció start-to-close. El PO elige qué type es P2. Cancel/terminate no están aquí.",
      "title": "Failed + timeout por workflow type",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true }, "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 22 },
      "id": 13,
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (temporal_namespace) (temporal_cloud_v1_total_action_count{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\", is_background=\"false\"})",
          "legendFormat": "actions {{temporal_namespace}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (temporal_namespace) (temporal_cloud_v1_action_limit{temporal_namespace=~\"$temporal_namespace\"})",
          "legendFormat": "limit {{temporal_namespace}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "description": "total_action_count{is_background=false} vs action_limit. Solo las no-background topan la cuota APS. Distinto de billable_action_count (factura, D03). % medio verde + throttle > 0 = burst de 1 min. > 80% sostenido = P3.",
      "title": "Actions vs action_limit",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["temporal-cloud", "slo"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Datasource",
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "options": [],
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "type": "datasource"
      },
      {
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
        "definition": "label_values(temporal_cloud_v1_service_request_count, temporal_namespace)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "label": "Namespace",
        "multi": true,
        "name": "temporal_namespace",
        "query": "label_values(temporal_cloud_v1_service_request_count, temporal_namespace)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "regex": "",
        "sort": 1,
        "type": "query"
      }
    ]
  },
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "Temporal Cloud SLO",
  "uid": "temporal-cloud-slo",
  "version": 5
}
